decisions: D-handles: origin operator-answer needs source.ref, the transcript turn it came from
decisions: D-kick: assistant-best-guess without best_guess_reason
decisions: D-kick: origin relayed must be decided_by operator
decisions: D-dark: unknown must be decided_by assistant-best-guess
decisions: D-dark: origin assistant must be decided_by assistant-best-guess
decisions: D-auto-deploy: pasted text is not the operator's decision; decided_by operator needs ratified_by (the operator turn that adopted it)
